  "notes": "Pets Universe is a pet collecting game on Roblox made by Lip Builds. You walk around picking up coins, spend them on eggs, and hatch pets that help you gather even more coins and rubies. There are hundreds of pets to find, the game gets new content every week, and joining the group and following the game gives bonus rewards.\n\nCodes give potions, fruit and sometimes Lucky Blocks. Luck and Hatch Potions are the most useful because they raise your chances of hatching rarer pets, so save them for your best egg. Update codes like Update2 arrive with the weekly updates and expire once the next one comes out, while creator codes named after YouTubers, such as DroverQ, have stayed active longer. Lip Builds shares new codes in its Discord.",
